        "english": "Shall we go and see a film this weekend?",
        "chinese": "这个周末我们去看电影吗？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 109040,
        "endMs": 114040,
        "english": "Sure, I love films. Me too. What would you like to see?",
        "chinese": "当然，我爱电影。我也喜欢。你想要看什么？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 114040,
        "endMs": 120040,
        "english": "I'd like to see Snow White. It's a story about a beautiful princess.",
        "chinese": "我想看白雪公主。这是一个关于美丽公主的故事。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 120040,
        "endMs": 126040,
        "english": "She meets seven little friends in the forest. It's an interesting film.",
        "chinese": "她遇见了森林里的七个好朋友。这是一部有趣的电影。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 126040,
        "endMs": 131040,
        "english": "But I'd like to see Police Story. It's an exciting film.",
        "chinese": "但是我想看看《警察故事》。那是一部激动人心的电影。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 131040,
        "endMs": 138040,
        "english": "What is it about? It's about a brave policeman. He catches bad people.",
        "chinese": "关于它，它是关于一个勇敢的警察。他抓坏人。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 138040,
        "endMs": 144390,
        "english": "I'd also like to see Snow White. Shall we see Police Story next time,",
        "chinese": "我也想看看白雪公主。下次我们去看警察故事吧？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 144390,
        "endMs": 145040,
        "english": "Peter?",
        "chinese": "彼得？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 145040,
        "endMs": 152430,
        "english": "Okay, let's go and see Snow White on Sunday afternoon. We can see",
